    34	Of 8 tested model configurations on C4, 6 yield $\Kempirical{=}2$; OLMo-1B ($\Kempirical{=}1$; 1v2 $\auc = 0.508$, CI $[0.496, 0.519]$) and Mistral-7B ($\Kempirical{=}1$; 1v2 $\auc = 0.594$, CI $[0.584, 0.603]$) fall below $\theta{=}0.60$, validating $\theta$ as an effective discriminator (gap: $0.508$--$0.594$ vs.\ $0.611$--$0.696$).
